  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Welcome to Cassine Gardens #101, a charming two-bedroom, two-and-a-half-bath townhome located in Santa Rosa Beach, Florida. This inviting coastal retreat comfortably sleeps six guests and offers a relaxed layout in a prime location just 0.4 miles from public beach access to the Gulf. With a covered, furnished patio, private balcony off the primary bedroom, and access to fantastic community amenities, this home is the perfect setting for your next 30A getaway.<br><br>The fully equipped kitchen comes complete with everything you need to whip up a quick beach snack or prepare a full gourmet dinner. Located on the first floor, the kitchen flows seamlessly into the living and dining areas, creating an open and comfortable space for gathering after a day at the beach. Whether you're enjoying morning coffee before heading out or sharing a family meal in the evening, this thoughtfully designed space makes vacation living easy and enjoyable. Just outside, the covered patio offers a relaxing spot to unwind, and a convenient laundry closet with a washer and dryer is located just off the patio for added convenience.<br><br>Upstairs, you’ll find both bedrooms and two full bathrooms, providing privacy and comfort for your group. The primary bedroom features an ensuite bathroom and a private balcony — the perfect place to start your day with fresh coastal air or wind down in the evening. The additional bedroom and full bathroom offer comfortable accommodations for family or friends, while the main level half bath adds extra convenience. The two-story layout creates a natural separation between living spaces and sleeping quarters, making it ideal for families or couples traveling together.<br><br>Guests of the Cassine Gardens community enjoy access to a variety of amenities designed to enhance your stay. Spend sunny afternoons at the sparkling community pool, challenge friends to a match on the tennis courts, or take a peaceful stroll along the scenic nature trail. The community also features a grill and picnic area for casual outdoor meals, as well as a catch-and-release lake for fishing. With public beach access just 0.4 miles away, you’re always just a short walk or bike ride from the sugar-white sands and emerald waters of the Gulf.<br><br>Located in the heart of Santa Rosa Beach along scenic 30A, this townhome places you close to some of the area’s best dining, shopping, and outdoor adventures. Explore local boutiques, enjoy fresh coastal cuisine, bike along nearby paths, or simply relax on the beach and soak in the laid-back charm that makes this stretch of Florida’s Gulf Coast so special.<br><br>If you’re looking for a comfortable and conveniently located coastal retreat with easy beach access and fantastic community amenities, Cassine Gardens #101 is ready to welcome you. Book your stay today and start making unforgettable memories along 30A.<br><br>Clean Coverlet Program: This property provides fresh and clean bed linens, including comforters and coverlets, laundered prior to every check-in.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Cassine Gardens #101 | 0.4mi to Beach, Lush Community Views + Amenities"
        }
      ],
